#: scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d4fd942216a55cda6148690b3b82d20db3ea358ce16d4a3f44bc06eb4a640c4
#. default-sha256: 9e3e3ddc0f5a353fccfbf1c73d86bdfa0b7a6eea144ee68fe24a80ec5af97419
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Come over here, "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫―――이리로 오려무"
"나, ⟪k:15⟫지젤."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc2733b3cd030b0a488beab48c9932a851fbf2ee2e0dbc8e76937923a1b73f4d
#. default-sha256: b51baff426726149e2db24163283a194c2b2c2265e60b343271b3ba2b13741dc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫O... ⟪k:1⟫Okay... ⟪k:2⟫Um, ⟪k:3⟫may I ask why you asked me here so late at night, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……아, ⟪k:1⟫……저기, ⟪k:2⟫……무슨 용건이신지요, ⟪k:3⟫주인어른…….⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫이런 오밤중에……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a636fb4cd6c3eb5980baadcd13f09a9e2cbfffd794b8d5451543994aab512f8
#. default-sha256: 5db52cc7ab0c20544aa981a3912930a847510ee4c33813416b9c4b85f788de7c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, I just wanted to have a little chat.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Care for some wine? ⟪k:3⟫Come closer, and "
"I’ll pour you a glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫뭐긴, ⟪k:1⟫너랑 담소를 좀 나눠 보고 싶었지. ⟪k:2⟫와인을 한 잔 내어 주마. ⟪k:3⟫가까이 오려무"
"나."

#: scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f74e14307d7e94cffe11725d03e4c296a351749b7f7f2889d477c57cd120883f
#. default-sha256: dddec68ee4ed2a5fc38114b0237aaf5f49b76447e9a8db116423f7ccce262000
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had this wine imported from up north.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They use very hard water, and like it "
"rather tart,⟪k:3⟫so it leaves quite the lasting impression on your tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이 와인은 북방에서 온 건데, ⟪k:1⟫혀가 저릿할 만큼 산미가 세. ⟪k:2⟫센물의 특성이 짙게 남은 게"
"지."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b53cc73dafe2f8287aabd59f5e7ce492115f04accf8445f74cc82e067de676a
#. default-sha256: 9f444b233d3607c0a094af97cadaa85ea0b3fab9f5f324e5f08422be3c8c1530
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And yet, it goes down so easily, you just can’t seem to stop.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What do you say? Have "
"a sip."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 놀라우리만치 ⟪k:1⟫술술 넘어가더구나. ⟪k:2⟫자, ⟪k:3⟫한 잔 마셔 보거라."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7342c948a9f19541b2ae8cb80a5dc51d62e12e0d7ad8c24d27287fd8435d088
#. default-sha256: d1278a88d14a38f1bc30553d893d87cfddf7bfb67fa4450933f70c4553612aae
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or does your expertise as a trader allow you to evaluate a wine’s quality without tasting it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아니면 ⟪k:1⟫장사를 하던 너니까 ⟪k:2⟫와인의 질을 마시지 않아도 알겠느냐?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de8eb32d17b69dd0943c72b78be702f72b37c1555d4ad802b6cefdbefeda4dca
#. default-sha256: 09fd6824f20b9484c8a1615f72f9991c73562cd3cd9777a1d927dc3a19c7389d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫but... ⟪k:3⟫um..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아, ⟪k:1⟫아뇨……, ⟪k:2⟫저기……, ⟪k:3⟫그래도……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9a0d0486206363b69ffeced7aaf404ab6ee1025c5b958124c5a363293f9321f
#. default-sha256: 8d80086d288d27123821f06d9af89e9a21b53de0efa8ea7bac290b004143120d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, Giselle, don’t trample all over my good graces."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어서, 지젤, ⟪k:1⟫내 호의를 함부로 하지 말려무나."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70f11dca8e8aaa71070da832b0a00fae04df3a26d734f2552dfdb02d42223306
#. default-sha256: f1f60afd24f6e6af8de2d2412de8182bb71ed085751cba871a597fe6a703ac7d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Very well then... ⟪k:1⟫I will have a sip, Master, but no more..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그럼……, ⟪k:1⟫한 모금만 마실게요. ⟪k:2⟫주인어른……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f8c0bf46cf140a1f3c6048c0c409b5aa5a2a9c812e8c57dc6af40189b37e034
#. default-sha256: 6428e791d5be58fd2ad0c4e18bfc6de00e274e5abe192b480d14a2cb7eb4baf9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Have you ever considered growing out your hair?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫너는 ⟪k:3⟫머리를 기를 생각은 없느냐?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb3d051133d1fd215d2af59d3088b6171db9d4047ccb109a046ed7de2fed4395
#. default-sha256: 2c4d8b1cdc042936ed2d3c6f2e057b17b5b37a68bac72825b24940fe797eb5c1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Having long hair made it difficult to do my job..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그게, ⟪k:1⟫일하는 데 거치적거리다 보니……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 712fa9fc65464d7b5299ad1090a1fb98fe42e2af24d9dc301ab3d589093a0fc7
#. default-sha256: 7d602cd9ee174fe60c36bcd13f3239e48522e00ec37804df50e3ee1f30968a3a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not a merchant anymore, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You deserve to look like the woman you truly "
"are."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지금은 ⟪k:1⟫장사꾼이 아니잖느냐. ⟪k:2⟫여자답게 길게 길러 보거라."

#: scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdcc5cab80f9cb4c6feaf3a2923f4aaa27d1106f3524a6e9168c66032ba6d2df
#. default-sha256: 8c8244f57e3c88316ae324a46e801b63f318edeafca87804e18bf366d560c43e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have no doubt longer hair would accentuate your natural beauty.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a gorgeous "
"shade of black, so deep a man could get lost in it for years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫긴 머리카락은 네 미모를 돋보이게 할 게야. ⟪k:1⟫아주 고운 흑발이잖느냐. ⟪k:2⟫모든 걸 빨아들일 "
"것처럼 ⟪k:3⟫깊이가 있어."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e1101abf1526df5def98c8f8e13130f7a12355a441bba850e1d339a4c71f9a3
#. default-sha256: f263a5d1b7267784facd31f22917191993c2bdb78e04ed0223d89fe124ab7ba0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would contrast the color of your skin fabulously.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Highlight your eyes, your "
"cheekbones, your nape, your shoulders, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and your chest..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫필시 ⟪k:1⟫네 살갗과 잘 어우러질 게야……. ⟪k:2⟫그 눈, ⟪k:3⟫옆모습, ⟪k:4⟫목, ⟪k:5⟫어깨, ⟪k:6⟫가"
"슴까지――, ⟪k:7⟫한층 더 부각시킬 테지."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c5a499a593c4c66145679d1ec0fa893b545a81da3d07cccf95bff3f10580739
#. default-sha256: f3d49f989a0a581429fd6cdb9e3ac655e78f9cf2d66915b8c59f23b406beaf77
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Um, I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I should get going..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저기, ⟪k:1⟫저…… 전, ⟪k:2⟫이만……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31cdc889cc6c336fe3f02d9afd121b55267aef8175b811cf3b1d2044f6a95346
#. default-sha256: 946d3d5daaf930678992b9d9335b35864f6cb72b00e7b5555fea557dd0d717d7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, but we’re not done talking yet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……담소는 아직 안 끝났잖느냐……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9bf71b122c8be64cc7cefa7575102b19759af6f3ead9cc108bfc35c9b8cd75b
#. default-sha256: 71dfaf085eb89b6e180b04f7930e05ed29d4040a295d7f8b62b9c79095c949fd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫I would not want a lack of sleep to interfere with my ability to work tomorrow. "
"⟪k:2⟫Thank you very much for the wine. It was delicio—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아뇨……, ⟪k:1⟫내일 일에 지장이 갈 테니까요. ⟪k:2⟫와인, ⟪k:3⟫잘 마셨습니다. ⟪k:4⟫맛있었――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1318cd90118bcc98d3e27de69b4520832f040dc63f8cc6a2220ed13c8c2517e2
#. default-sha256: 634b2db880c7cd181533e544e290f99f4aae2d4b663d56b72acfe29231b9f4e5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫………!?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b6a95b90cbbaea08765f1bebe09e38150e44ae93a0dfd0db45aac5b4539e86b
#. default-sha256: ac5f34c139b8ee7cc9db0dfb2a14dc9dbe6d11b66b03468bb89a4e57e3391438
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so cold-hearted, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From the moment I first laid eyes on you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇게 쌀쌀맞게 굴면 쓰나. ⟪k:1⟫나는 너를 처음 본 순간부터……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb8abb6ebf614701d514f2a34b3b52a137f1b66601dac313fadc3f16effab626
#. default-sha256: ef8b0720526440022b539900d0ec3b1fa9221b7b7f8ec7a4d2dd08d51245b174
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫M— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That’s enough fooling around for one night!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫주――, ⟪k:1⟫주인어른! ⟪k:2⟫노, ⟪k:3⟫농담은 그만해 주세요……!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf06428f467e783bc97375953171df3f063ab4761be3709d2b7a35fe66f15ede
#. default-sha256: 48cd7e9bfc1c152a03a808d4f7ad5031a5c6f283e28838ac7378be09b84ffc5e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, now, don’t be afraid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wouldn’t do anything to hurt you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I simply "
"want to express my love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫겁낼 것 없어. ⟪k:1⟫걱정 말거라, ⟪k:2⟫만족스럽게 해 주고 말고.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫내가―― 너를 사랑해 주"
"마."

#: scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6ca12dd99be1342697972a2c06a91237094c7f4de9f72347620259779093647
#. default-sha256: efb3bf6e61550c83b3ab344998576889444a149000fe8aaa7a768ff8f1210a39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫L— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Let go of me!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I-I only came here to work, nothing more!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫놔……, ⟪k:1⟫놔 주세요! ⟪k:2⟫저, ⟪k:3⟫전 ⟪k:4⟫이러려고 온 거 아니에요!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
