msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hahahah... ⟪k:1⟫It would seem you’re even more innocent than you look. ⟪k:2⟫But you’ve "
"figured it all out by now, haven’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫허허허……, ⟪k:1⟫생긴 거랑 달리 ⟪k:2⟫이쪽 방면은 잘 모르나 보구나. ⟪k:3⟫허나 이제 ⟪k:4⟫의미를 "
"이해했지?"

