msgstr "⟪k:0⟫만약 네가 난리를 치며, ⟪k:1⟫보기 흉하게 굴면……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FB58F1C5_D35D_4C26_86C6_2FFEB1136DFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b06921d84893a89e7a99a7ebbf6eae41eb35c3771314175b947da44c845f43d3
