msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I couldn’t break free of his grip,⟪k:1⟫and I found myself entirely at his mercy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 ⟪k:1⟫헛된 저항 끝에 ⟪k:2⟫순순히 당할 수밖에 없었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_45F76FD9_9F7E_4E43_86F5_6620D3488462
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f470a28ca5634b3ddf3aef7b244137aee2801ff9f5c4ad3f8d4ec65f40ea8ee
