msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Beneath the gaudy outfits lay a hungry beast—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and I was seeing the creature’s true "
"colors for the first time that day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫화사한 옷도 ⟪k:1⟫한 꺼풀 벗기고 보면――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 안에 추악한 짐승이 있단 걸 ⟪k:4⟫처음으로 "
"⟪k:5⟫깨달았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9B196898_354A_4489_9CA9_BAF707EF76F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
