msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9B196898_354A_4489_9CA9_BAF707EF76F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The aging man ran his disgusting, slobbery tongue across my exposed skin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이미 노인에 가까운 남자의 혀가 ⟪k:1⟫내 살갗 위를 기어다니며――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫더러운 침을 남겼다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_81B4FA23_2C84_4A9C_9A79_33678BDF2A14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86e9a5d270e101a2f68ffe8c69fb00a096267d17446b97dd42afee904c0ff9f9
