msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Everything he placed his hands upon withered away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Every piece of flesh he pressed "
"his lips against putrefied."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 남자가 만진 부분이, ⟪k:1⟫입을 댄 부분이 ⟪k:2⟫모두 썩으려 했다……. ⟪k:3⟫나를 썩은 시체로 만"
"들어 갔다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2E662970_A12C_4FFF_99C7_A01BB9BDA1F0
