msgid "⟪k:0⟫Rotted. ⟪k:1⟫Decayed. ⟪k:2⟫Rankled."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫죽어 갔다. ⟪k:1⟫말라 갔다. ⟪k:2⟫썩어 갔다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_04C8F86F_C6FD_4025_9EFC_4FAE6698EC7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
