msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I trembled in revulsion, at which the man laughed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫seemingly interpreting it "
"as something else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 남자는 소름이 끼쳐 떠는 나를 보더니, ⟪k:1⟫무슨 반응으로 착각한 건지 ⟪k:2⟫실실 웃었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E67AFB0D_3773_49F8_A138_CD8B727CCBF1
