msgid "⟪k:0⟫If Hell’s wardens only flayed and carved their prisoners,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지옥의 간수들이 하는 업무가 ⟪k:1⟫내 피부를 벗기며 ⟪k:2⟫날붙이로 살을 찌르는 게 다라면――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D88FD3B3_B1C1_4FE0_A103_BFA358CD73C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
