msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_63F86A23_D59C_4E76_8C96_C020FFDC019A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I would have chosen eternal torment over being touched by this man another second."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지옥의 고문이―― ⟪k:1⟫이 남자에게 농락당하는 것보다……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 안에선 ⟪k:4⟫훨씬 나았다."

