#: scenario5:scenario5_E85D3B08_9371_4C16_B01C_BDBA086A8B13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e67198000050915a1f34887728b2c8fa7608e7c5f81f4efc200285e5a1705e0
#. default-sha256: 2b1991bbfa01786e370013a03c570e67928e54c1fe98e887205041d67605ac9a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E85D3B08_9371_4C16_B01C_BDBA086A8B13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not when he used my family against me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫가족을 들먹이는 이상 ⟪k:1⟫내게 뾰족한 수는 없었다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CAB4FC3E_B6B4_4B87_9124_7DCB0BA53DC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ffe7e58e152a9a3988b40e3141c9715dc04aa82458f620c7316ce6e692afa97
#. default-sha256: 3cb99c25ec044426e7da22e81ca8aad76a9d96ea0cdadc0b1dbabcb926db8ec2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CAB4FC3E_B6B4_4B87_9124_7DCB0BA53DC3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Some weeks, I would just not go to his chambers—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫my one feeble means of resistance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그렇긴 해도, ⟪k:1⟫반항이나마 하고자 ⟪k:2⟫남자의 방에 안 간 적이 있다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫하지만 그랬더"
"니――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F399059F_178A_4AB0_8FE0_B2275000D3F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01b644ffe52cbc42dc5be86dbb5b9a802ed55a33d6fa5a778d41e3d54584bd80
#. default-sha256: ec3b457a01e916d03247e9a9356ae277d98290725f645decade17af82a19682e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F399059F_178A_4AB0_8FE0_B2275000D3F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But when I did that, he would send another abigail to come find me the next day. ⟪k:1⟫I "
"couldn’t ignore his summons when he got other people involved."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 다음 날, ⟪k:1⟫다른 시녀가 나를 부르러 왔다. ⟪k:2⟫……다른 인간을 보내면 ⟪k:3⟫무시도 못 한다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_886D2DFD_942B_4BA8_8FC0_A072A7886AE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c406e01517abfa278cfd832922189bf64b95d0f5da1f3665ea0ead7d33358348
#. default-sha256: 0a7457e601d3863cabb49bb275d7eeba35907b495ff829e3cf30119c1f3d6aaa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_886D2DFD_942B_4BA8_8FC0_A072A7886AE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then, when the two of us were alone, the mask would come off,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫그 남자는 ⟪k:2⟫나와 둘만 남는 즉시 표변하여――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D11C88CF_C171_4381_9450_5E6279F4AF97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd23769206d9395379ae3cca6b4693fb55bc513255f54c60c411942ed5a1de81
#. default-sha256: 07b57e6f12e4dc6950b61e2102d8386879d2947f9bc24bb9a379ec96d8dd1254
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D11C88CF_C171_4381_9450_5E6279F4AF97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and he would “discipline” me for not showing up before taking care of his usual business."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「왜 안 왔냐」면서 길길이 날뛰며, ⟪k:1⟫나를 안기 전에 ⟪k:2⟫맴매란 이름의 처벌을 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_487321FA_69B5_4FF3_82F3_19BF5A231845
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff2d7d92c057fbc4ebee55d5070cd10d4b7015055b3bb48a304d02dc8b4419bf
#. default-sha256: 32927fdb412c9a6ae974df58b3b00f3968f207ea8f135aa7e801ba22fb2409c3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_487321FA_69B5_4FF3_82F3_19BF5A231845"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On good days, he would leave bruises in inconspicuous places—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫my abdomen, my "
"inner thighs..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫눈에 띄는 부분 대신……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫하복부나 ⟪k:3⟫허벅지 안쪽에 상처를 입혔고――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5CE5A523_0BAA_4371_83D5_B334F54E9CD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ad6df1a1d5dc62ea8e02f5146a24579573218b80ac6089af0650ab0ff92c0a8
#. default-sha256: 4252a5baae08660d6762b49613f2b888457986f1732f57c671ccc9fe80d2e701
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5CE5A523_0BAA_4371_83D5_B334F54E9CD3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but he went as far as carving a word into my skin with a knife:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫심할 때는 ⟪k:1⟫나이프 끝을 써서 ⟪k:2⟫내 피부 위에 ⟪k:3⟫문자를 새기려 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6F64A8B0_4922_4A72_AD3B_624686998328
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56b5a805c37e7ea32c307ccd66465d75b885c2d2c3e75745d5a779262f481018
#. default-sha256: 26cf766efa84c8fa67e7d4b2600e36154f6d3ed9f7d9466fb159d4544501b4ae
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6F64A8B0_4922_4A72_AD3B_624686998328"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“HARLOT”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――알뜰상품년⟪k:1⟫이라고."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E1C46550_37FA_410B_99C4_9B80A3380C52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0bc30cf57d51d77b104bb5436089adef512b62a06b15fe50775b88c4e2638a4
#. default-sha256: b3cc59a1e9ab73b15a5fb3509bb0807dda156f234ea79e725c51ddadf51e4509
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E1C46550_37FA_410B_99C4_9B80A3380C52"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was why I was afraid of knives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서 ⟪k:1⟫나는…… 날붙이가 무섭다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E6E9EE2F_B390_4656_B00F_C3A012929933
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b0a3988d291be13fa89bb1783c507755959e1a1236d091433b0db43b975a6c9
#. default-sha256: a910e45b00d417a8c304e11ad7e30d3376fd5d9dd4d0c7fa01be4d7801843303
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E6E9EE2F_B390_4656_B00F_C3A012929933"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was why I was afraid of men shouting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서 ⟪k:1⟫나는…… 남자의 호통이 무섭다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9195DB89_6797_4324_B511_9CEC5DAD8063
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2872beeaa970c74081d4bbbf7983aaa0e2b39da9fdf0ae8bca7ad51a251a725
#. default-sha256: 03e09452dbbc9bb1495c3c07b8276c2b064587466cd64552fa27c40a3cedbf35
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9195DB89_6797_4324_B511_9CEC5DAD8063"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t even sure what to regret anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……뭘 후회해야 하는지도 ⟪k:1⟫알 수 없었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_43B1A0FA_A5F5_4560_A2D9_68B226FC7D80
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5801cae4fd90b41c1e3b2a1ae59a635075b2d9cbaa9edfc15d36494ac9b1dab9
#. default-sha256: 73abb4e60d4ed33d72156b5609e63d95142ee4c0a15cefff680790c619061d36
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_43B1A0FA_A5F5_4560_A2D9_68B226FC7D80"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was in far too deep. ⟪k:1⟫There was no turning back the clock."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이미 돌이킬 수 없는 데까지 ⟪k:1⟫오고 말았다. ⟪k:2⟫시간의 너울을 되돌리는 것은 ⟪k:3⟫불가능하"
"다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9715B063_124D_411D_A32D_39BDFE2EB060
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53360bac13520bea2baea1fb1aa0be06ab0f0cf57a46916db6dd5ca3288235d2
#. default-sha256: 8b92aaeb3be4203156d4a2fbbe1ae563d5b690416972c2ea55ee3a074fefb0c8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9715B063_124D_411D_A32D_39BDFE2EB060"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even considered taking my own life on more than one occasion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫차라리 ⟪k:1⟫이 목숨을 끊는 게 나은 건가 싶기도 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7E283FE5_63BE_4AA5_AE0C_A33689D95472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9473661aabfa6165783af44a0563b6d000d45a8cec404ebf7c4011b16ba1b74e
#. default-sha256: a7c0c8304a18ee97676d9b37813a2c9c96a70ab03ec922bd6cc159cce75612f1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7E283FE5_63BE_4AA5_AE0C_A33689D95472"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every time the thought crossed my mind, happy memories came with it. ⟪k:1⟫Back when it "
"was just the three of us girls and the shop.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Life may not have been easy, but it was "
"never dull either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫꼭 그럴 때만 되면 ⟪k:2⟫즐겁던 예전 추억이 떠올랐다. ⟪k:3⟫힘든 생활 속에서도 ⟪k:4⟫"
"엄마와 언니, ⟪k:5⟫여자 셋이서 떠들썩하게 지내던 나날이……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_12D5D2EE_6477_4AA3_9995_C3BD3F5831CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34509ec3306d9c1148f36c43efc34230d019a4e82b904ca3f340a3c5e4b5793d
#. default-sha256: 0b91eba1ecb0483a48581dc1379883231e5480402842f4e145922e872659838b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_12D5D2EE_6477_4AA3_9995_C3BD3F5831CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t want to end my life at its absolute lowest point."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……이런 끔찍한 상황, ⟪k:1⟫끔찍한 기분, ⟪k:2⟫끔찍한 심정을 품은 채로 ⟪k:3⟫죽긴 싫었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD06AF7E_2560_45F2_944E_1B58C87617FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae6ae9352d9a1c5a547cda0c746a3eb7c0e1063758fedf0f4c7f0dd1e8ce6694
#. default-sha256: 1318c434422d7a41061e4caee53032839d2048250b484c323923da3dca35e9e9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD06AF7E_2560_45F2_944E_1B58C87617FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted, if just temporarily,⟪k:1⟫to go back to the way things were back then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫다시 한 번―― 최소한 한 번이라도.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫평화롭고 ⟪k:3⟫행복한 나날을 되찾고 싶었다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5076E858_BDAB_43D6_A3FC_A3D71291F331
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe24df3fd6967e6531ffba51e84e950c742ae5a8ef7dea21a9fd62b81df8ba1c
#. default-sha256: bf09ac640a70c5ea03fbe9c77c25a951476a3dc00d02b8e27a6947137a513e3e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5076E858_BDAB_43D6_A3FC_A3D71291F331"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That objective was the only thing that allowed me to keep going."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 그 의지 하나만으로 ⟪k:1⟫볼랭저 저택에서의 나날을 견뎠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C06E73D9_3101_4E8A_B88B_AF079759DA99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e6cac8901e1bef46a47bec07a17a393e77745d832f604f2aac582b595a46ef1
#. default-sha256: 6d6eb778a4d18ca0d3dddb822109689b9e677eec4368b8e27f700a51821fc6a1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C06E73D9_3101_4E8A_B88B_AF079759DA99"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I was in his presence, I tried to convince myself I was merely an object.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I "
"had no emotions, so he couldn’t hurt me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 그 남자 앞에서 ⟪k:1⟫물건이라 치기로 했다. ⟪k:2⟫감정이 없으면 ⟪k:3⟫다칠 일도 없다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2B02D1E2_4760_41EA_A31F_5E9954ACB823
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a9d620df1be6b2bcecb7580557856115b9ca63d3227a27d941f62a8bbebb520
#. default-sha256: 5da6cf3eccf3f3a329b0afd9313a76e4b82da4b64f71f40bbc2e114f6214fc36
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2B02D1E2_4760_41EA_A31F_5E9954ACB823"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His hands couldn’t reach my heart,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 껍데기 뿐. ⟪k:1⟫그냥 살덩이. ⟪k:2⟫그 남자가 만지는 것은 ⟪k:3⟫내 마음이 아니다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F7E4BD27_0335_40CB_B922_23CF301116D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63dfb97bc2b36fd0c7b8b2bc4225d618a2a44ec28ed2214042ec862fd33c39fd
#. default-sha256: 7e1f0c04ddfb5b228159cc5d5b60a5ea1abb8b97690f0e5117616cdf356346a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F7E4BD27_0335_40CB_B922_23CF301116D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for it was not connected to my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 마음과 육체는 ⟪k:1⟫연결되지 않았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CB63FF7A_0A1D_4306_85E6_F190B75C2889
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3781dd618879f9d30c27c9deb8bf10e26814600a61c691622bc6ac3ab07b55cc
#. default-sha256: 002bb4fc5bbe54579837b644a5c971352e668d55d637bdf4449d493336690042
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CB63FF7A_0A1D_4306_85E6_F190B75C2889"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doing that made it a little easier to bear,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러고 있으면 ⟪k:1⟫어느 정도 편해지긴 했지만……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BD46EAB8_8A67_4B7B_99A7_D121E318BF44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e66b6b07983fed7d136eee77249ab7ba37de7abd30e44579a6cddc1b9638ebf
#. default-sha256: 83af88b40f3312ef5104304ba6a40cfe890b81a7fd518653a6dc8bc53aedd88d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BD46EAB8_8A67_4B7B_99A7_D121E318BF44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but the reality was, it was impossible to completely sever my heart from my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫결국 ⟪k:1⟫마음과 육체를 ⟪k:2⟫완전히 차단하는 것은⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫불가능하다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A71F91C_EF9C_4C00_9A8B_C5595B2028FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7973d6977910118e0ef1062055876d509e69b9cc6499fc7bb24e0d9d4949da84
#. default-sha256: 7a1837277d1ffcff36f0d26275f57731ab1dc028d6967eec360a01591b347553
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A71F91C_EF9C_4C00_9A8B_C5595B2028FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’re Giselle, aren’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫―――네가 지젤이구나."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DF037EBD_D86C_45CA_9C5F_83A724E96A00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b57e1f3f706115c61859c55e0aa6a052c2faf551c2468872ded019ba723c83d6
#. default-sha256: 5d6e994182df6294d7f76c6b0ab5a9bcb4b69c0cd00a13fa0de1ed585f9249fb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DF037EBD_D86C_45CA_9C5F_83A724E96A00"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫One day, the mistress of the estate stopped me in the halls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어느 날, ⟪k:1⟫저택 복도에서 나를 부른 건 ⟪k:2⟫볼랭저 가문의 안주인이었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CAECF07_8336_4ED7_B3F0_227FF0ADDFB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b736e966fe0f7902839e038a5d252eb1cb5e0017558d87c90a5c0266d9662e1
#. default-sha256: 2d77b0dc9e31475add1837575dc4759152b6d79e05ac9277b6579913250f8fd6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CAECF07_8336_4ED7_B3F0_227FF0ADDFB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, supposedly, once been quite beautiful, but now she was only haggard and bony."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫예전에는 몹시 아름다운 사람이었다는데,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫초췌한 얼굴에 ⟪k:3⟫그 흔적은 없었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EB611ACB_B35D_4124_8B3B_C13FE06A9AA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 492b50647ab3bfb14411a4879197a08cb33506df80ad038c92e88999540eec44
#. default-sha256: a6aafc36d258be4b9fca4f505e49e0035ed640d51708e236356d4a9ddefcfb47
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EB611ACB_B35D_4124_8B3B_C13FE06A9AA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her skin dry, her eyes sunken, her hair faded and stripped of its luster, her head down, her "
"cracked lips barely moving as she spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫바싹 마른 피부, ⟪k:1⟫푹 꺼진 눈가, ⟪k:2⟫윤기 없이 빛바랜 금발, ⟪k:3⟫구부정한 자세, ⟪k:4⟫갈라"
"진 입술에서 나오는 음울한 목소리."

#: scenario5:scenario5_126DFA18_91A2_4506_8DF7_0D01694C541B
