msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I didn’t even ⟪k:1⟫have⟪k:2⟫ to make a fuss about it...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It happened all on its "
"own...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(결국…… ⟪k:1⟫내가 잠자코 있어도 ⟪k:2⟫이렇게 되는구나……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D0D48B02_B5B7_4C49_8229_FD5177A76C62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
