msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I didn’t have the energy to argue with her, or to cry, or to shout."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫부정할 힘도, ⟪k:2⟫질질 짤 힘도, ⟪k:3⟫버럭 성을 낼 힘도, ⟪k:4⟫내 안에 남지 않았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7927DA29_EC30_4681_ABB9_446DBF2E267B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb71b7d1d22f979bf485b6c4ec03cd90d7d58bb89626f99d385f0c1424913df8
