msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7927DA29_EC30_4681_ABB9_446DBF2E267B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Before long, a crowd began to form around me and the sobbing mistress—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and in it "
"stood him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫난리를 치는 안주인과 ⟪k:1⟫우두커니 선 내 주위에 ⟪k:2⟫이윽고 사람들이 모였고―― 그 안에는 ⟪k:3⟫"
"그 남자도 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6D36D0F3_1DEF_4CCA_9866_5579CD4F894E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddef16b2a4294511b5e4301fc0fdad562760a7cc4a5f188bf04a127f6a9b04df
