msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One of the previous Bollinger family heads had purchased a mansion there long ago, but it "
"had been abandoned because of the stories people told about it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫예전에 볼랭저 가문 주인이 사들였는데, ⟪k:1⟫안 좋은 소문이 도느라 ⟪k:2⟫그냥 방치하기로 한 저"
